      "design_rule": "Keep the input matrix, variant definitions, ordering, acceptance rules and budgets fixed. Do not tune production controllers or discard misses using these outcomes.",
      "order": "Rows in the declared order, separately within development and reserved partitions; no claim of search superiority",
      "reduction_budget_per_detected_variant": 24,
      "reduction_partition": "reserved",
      "reduction_rule": "First attributable detection per variant; greedily move demand toward the fixed priming case and shorten age/uncertainty, preserving primary failure category. Retain the service contract and priming state. Bounded simplification, not global minimality.",
      "attribution": "Reference must pass the existing electrical AND service contract. Detect candidate rejection, new electrical failure, failed service contract or a service loss exceeding the existing 0.1 kW tolerance. Reference failures are inconclusive, never counted as defect detections.",
