        "nominal-control": "Unmodified nominal selection with a different ID; negative control",
        "guarded-control": "Unmodified guarded selection with a different ID; negative control",
        "skip-feasibility": "Nominal ranker omits the nominal electrical-feasibility filter",
        "reverse-service": "Nominal ranker reverses critical and total service ranking signs",
        "cached-action": "Nominal controller retains its first action across a changed observation",
        "reverse-operations": "Nominal selector reverses a multi-operation plan; interface rejection is separate from an electrical detection",
        "ignore-uncertainty": "Guarded controller accidentally applies nominal filtering and loading rank; ablation against the explicit guarded specification"
